OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads not guilty to attempted
OL,4,Amurder over north Belfast stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fattempted murder at Belfast
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,10,FThe charges relate to a stabbing in
OL,11,Fnorth Belfast on 23 August 2024.
OL,13,FConneth Paul Johnston, 27, of
OL,14,FForthriver Park in Belfast, stood in
OL,15,Fthe dock as the charges were read out
OL,16,Fto him.
OL,18,FHe pleaded not guilty to other charges
OL,19,Fincluding aggravated burglary with
OL,20,Fintent to inflict grievous bodily harm
OL,21,Fand assault on police.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
